{"answer": 1, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span> 곱의 미분법을 쓴다</div>\n    $$\n    f'(x)=3\\left(x^2-2x+2\\right)+(3x-1)(2x-2)=9x^2-14x+8.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> \\(x=2\\)를 대입한다</div>\n    $$\n    f'(2)=36-28+8=16.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;①</div>\n"}